  "section": "14",
  "quote": "A provision in a tenancy agreement prohibiting the presence of animals in or about the residential complex is void.",
  "reason": "Section 14 only makes provisions void if they prohibit the presence of animals in or about the residential complex. Because this clause does not prohibit keeping animals and only requires that they do not damage the unit or disturb other residents, it does not conflict with the Act and is allowed."
}

